# prose-audit: Grade A — Lewica negotiates the list in first person, the legal thresholds stay concrete, and acceptance is delivered as a political verdict rather than a scorecard.
title: The October list negotiation
subtitle: Host-party control at 5%, coalition autonomy at 8%, and partners who can walk away
new-page: true
